# Options for the c5div service (see `c5div --help`).
# Output by jumper (docs/WIRING.md): GPIO4-GND fitted = AV, open = HDMI;
# GPIO5-GND fitted = web viewer. Or fixed:
#   HDMI only:            --output hdmi
#   composite AV only:    --output av        (--av-std pal|ntsc to force a standard)
#   Wi-Fi viewer only:    --output web --web-port 80
#   one receiver:         --rx A
C5DIV_ARGS="--source smi --output jumpers --web-port 80"
